    "All operations are source-only until Lane B issuer, client audience and dedicated WACRM staging certify",
    "Provider-specific Graph host blueprints require upstream Meta app scope and WABA resource ownership",
    "WACRM owns customer consent, 24-hour window, per-recipient policy, real retry/dedupe/outbox and webhook events",
    "No phone registration, migration, deregistration or app subscription automation in this manifest",
    "Advanced Graph request forms may require vendor-version review before production runtime binding"
  ],
